comp('4.3.3','Fuels management','Plan and implement hazardous fuels treatments',
 'Assesses fuels, prescribes and implements mechanical, biological or prescribed-fire treatments, and monitors their effectiveness so treatments meet fire-behavior and resource objectives within safety and legal constraints. Span L1-L4. NWCG position qualifications and equipment certifications are qualification gates; burn execution is v1 4.3.2.')
