ind('4.3.3','L2','Drafts a site-specific fuels treatment prescription that states objectives, target fuel conditions, methods, constraints and monitoring measures for a single unit.','work-product: prescription scored by fuels SME rubric','mode=assisted; use=select; replaces v1 I I2; obs4=3')
