ind('4.1.3','L3','Adapts the sampling plan when flow, access or safety conditions prevent planned collection, documenting the deviation and its effect on data comparability.','simulation|interview: case scenario plus structured interview','mode=assisted; use=promote; attribute=complexity and guidelines; obs4=3')
